  "definition": "A weighted score measuring human suffering, calculated with the formula: (10 * COALESCE(casualties, 0)) + (3 * COALESCE(injured, 0)) + (2 * COALESCE(missing, 0)) + (1 * COALESCE(displaced, 0))."
